    "stdout": "SharedTrace.mixed_trace_estimate.{u_1, u_2, u_3} {n0 : Type u_1} {n1 : Type u_2} {n2 : Type u_3} [Fintype n0]\n  [Fintype n1] [Fintype n2] [DecidableEq n0] [DecidableEq n1] [DecidableEq n2] (W0 : Matrix n0 n1 \u2102)\n  (W1 : Matrix n1 n2 \u2102) (W2 : Matrix n2 n0 \u2102) (D0 : Matrix n0 n0 \u2102) (D1 : Matrix n1 n1 \u2102) (D2 : Matrix n2 n2 \u2102)\n  (h0 : D0.IsHermitian) (h1 : D1.IsHermitian) (h2 : D2.IsHermitian) :\n  have R0 := W0.fromCols W2\u1d34;\n  have R1 := W1.fromCols W0\u1d34;\n  have R2 := W2.fromCols W1\u1d34;\n  \u2016(D0 * W0 * D1 * W1 * D2 * W2).trace\u2016 \u2264\n    5 / 3 * max \u2016toEuclideanCLM D0\u2016 (max \u2016toEuclideanCLM D1\u2016 \u2016toEuclideanCLM D2\u2016) *\n      (SharedTraceHessian.b \u22ef (R0\u1d34 * D0 * R0) + SharedTraceHessian.b \u22ef (R1\u1d34 * D1 * R1) +\n        SharedTraceHessian.b \u22ef (R2\u1d34 * D2 * R2))\n'SharedTrace.mixed_trace_estimate' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n",
